New Screenshot.png", "id": "1383205436302268", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619809_1383205442968934_4795206938435697675_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3XnVq25-ySMQ7kNvwEdVgX8&_nc_oc=AdpmWN4ZByQ3t4wRZVhMI0gFbvphQX7ihIA0-8PEyr9noQEpSzqmluy45bDY70GiCV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPyM1SPkaSCXMAKbWYz-S4Jeh5hZlSWzB7kn-CONcWGYw&oe=6AE350EE"}, {"file_name": "2024 Product Page Screenshots - 8.png", "id": "937941248048494", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982608_937941251381827_4208153383432172814_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5USOUob9UW8Q7kNvwEhEoJl&_nc_oc=Adp60xqmjB5IgVlS_9khXw6EysDNzbVB9AfKMIktVFDyXHNY1z2n8MS7MLFSN8joiPc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNwBAQNZjHH5nwz5PHJSeOmSrYHLy6q_wJRVOitkjgnKg&oe=6AE35DF2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GC_CoverArt_SpiderMascot2026_Landscape.png", "id": "1419132063137081", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1419132069803747_5890057729197790853_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=84Gwi6V0iR8Q7kNvwHapRK2&_nc_oc=Adp4D0W4wBLlt6S6A7cqkRL_yCmThle3ZL7HCuxWfGKDQ6OaEYXdPlAL--kKJb1vuHc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOh3fxtjBuFQS0ePodstGk_50RPgyCFLtWvqU-Hx3SOLw&oe=6AE33CEC"}, "display_name": "Gym Class", "keywords": ["basketball", "nba", "boxing", "football", "baseball"], "long_description": "**GYM CLASS is the #1 best rated sports game on Meta Quest** - play basketball, boxing, football, soccer, baseball, & paintball with realistic physics & massive multiplayer worlds.  \ud83c\udfc0\ud83e\udd4a\ud83c\udfc8\u26bd\u26be\ud83c\udfa8\n\nExperience NBA-licensed team courts and player jerseys, MLB-licensed ballparks and uniforms. Hang with friends, compete, & unlock gear. With weekly updates, there\u2019s always something new in Gym Class VR.\n\n{845878341488272}\n\n**Download FREE today:** \n- \u2705  **Realistic VR Physics**: bring real-life moves to shooting, boxing, dribbling, dunking, pitching, & batting.\n- \ud83c\udfae  **Multiplayer + AI**: compete with friends, meet new players, or practice with AI\n- \ud83c\udf0d  **Massive Worlds**: socialize, explore, & play in large environments built for VR\n- \ud83c\udfc0\u26be\ud83c\udfc8  **Instant Gear**: spawn balls, gloves, & gadgets anywhere\n- \ud83c\udfaf **Challenges + Unlocks**: earn hoodies, jerseys, suits, hats, glasses, mascots, \u201cgreen\u201d effects, gadgets, & more\n\n{1193253625573297}\n\n**NBA Bundle unlocks:**\n- \ud83d\ude2e **30 NBA team Courts**: Virtual replicas of all 30 NBA team courts in arenas & training facilities.\n- \ud83c\udfc6 **NBA team gear**: team apparel sets, ball, and hat - unlock more by playing\n\n{969686844967912}\n\n**MLB Bundle unlocks:**\n- \u26be **30 MLB Ballparks**: 30 MLB branded ballparks with roaring crowds.\n- \ud83d\udc55 **Official Uniforms**: Home & away jerseys, cap & helmet for your favorite MLB club.\n\n{1174479781362169}\n\n**GC PRO unlocks:**\n- \ud83c\udfe0 **Private Servers**: Custom lobbies to play w/ friends\n- \ud83d\udc55 **Full-body Avatars**: customize face details, hair, body shape, height, tattoos, & facial hair..\n- \ud83e\udd16 **PRO Challenges**: premium cosmetic challenges.\n\n{557813239965509}", "short_description": "GYM CLASS is the top VR sports (\ud83c\udfc0 basketball, \ud83e\udd4a boxing, \ud83c\udfc8 football, \u26bdsoccer, \u26be baseball, \ud83c\udfa8 paintball) game. Experience NBA licensed team courts & jerseys, MLB licensed ballparks & uniforms, multiplayer games, simulation physics, and massive worlds. Rated best on Quest - make friends or level-up to be the best among millions in the top VR sports community."}]}, "developer_name": "IRL Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gymclass.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://gymclass.com/tos", "publisher_name":